<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not well tested on a live basis, compared with Thursday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1275 lbs ld 65.50 Reported sales for Friday: 100   Week to Date: 100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
